Title: The Worst Pitch
Author: Test User

INT. COFFEE SHOP - DAY

SARAH drops a thick presentation folder onto the table.

SARAH
I have created the future of social networking.

NOAH
That sentence has ruined several economies.

Sarah ignores him and opens the folder.

SARAH
It's an app where people rate other people's houseplants.

Noah stares at her.

NOAH
So... judgmental gardening?

Sarah beams.

SARAH
Exactly.

> CUT TO:

INT. STARTUP OFFICE - LATER

Sarah presents to three INVESTORS.

SARAH
Imagine LinkedIn, but every employee is a fern.

The investors exchange worried looks.

One investor slowly raises a hand.

INVESTOR
Who is the customer?

Sarah pauses.

SARAH
Plants.

Silence.

NOAH, sitting in the back, covers his face.

> CUT TO:

EXT. PARK - SUNSET

Sarah and Noah sit on a bench.

SARAH
They weren't ready.

NOAH
One of them asked security to walk us out.

Sarah watches a pigeon steal a french fry.

SARAH
Disruption always looks strange at first.

Noah sighs.
